   "text": "Thank you, Aisha. You're verified, and I've checked your order.\n\nYour Saffron Lane order (Q-7101) was promised for 6:30 PM. The courier handed it over at 7:20 PM, which is 50 minutes late. Orders that arrive 45 minutes or more late get account credit of 20% of the order subtotal. Your subtotal was $44.50, so I've added **$8.90** in account credit. You can use it on a future order.\n\nI'm sorry about the wait. Is there anything else I can help with?"
